   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "Slumping onto a stool at the Claude Monet bar, Max attempts to recover from a sleepless night of drinking at the nightclub. Bartender Kostya immediately detects the painful signs of a hangover and pours a lifesaving jug of cold water for the young newcomer. Let's listen to their conversation in Russian first.",
